Package: traybeat
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Matthias Zartmann <mail@ma-za.de>
Depends: libc6, python3-gi, python3-gst-1.0, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: TrayBeat a music player in the system tray
 TrayBeat can play web radio and M3U and MP3 playlists 
 and runs in the tray area. This programm is designed specifically
 for KDE Plasma 6 and runs in the system tray as a small music player. 
 It supports both, web radio stations and m3u MP3 playlists.
